      "start_seconds": 1.11,
      "end_seconds": 2.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 3.54,
      "end_seconds": 7.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.85,
      "end_seconds": 11.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "it's sore, gritty eyes mostly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.02,
      "end_seconds": 13.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "when did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.36,
      "end_seconds": 21.51,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "Two years, I think... sorry, about a year, I got that wrong"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.01,
      "end_seconds": 31.06,
      "duration_seconds": 9.05,
      "text": "Sure. Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets how often and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.81,
      "end_seconds": 39.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "I'd give it a eight out of ten it's worse with wind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.82,
      "end_seconds": 44.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "any loss of vision or flashing lights at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.44,
      "end_seconds": 48.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "no, none of those at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.11,
      "end_seconds": 52.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "right, how about eye pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.89,
      "end_seconds": 57.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Nope, no eye pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.75,
      "end_seconds": 62.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "alright any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.78,
      "end_seconds": 71.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "nothing on the the skin, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.29,
      "end_seconds": 83.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.53,
      "end_seconds": 87.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "No I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.68,
      "end_seconds": 108.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.16,
      "end_seconds": 114.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "no, not that I know of"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.5,
      "end_seconds": 117.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.21,
      "end_seconds": 122.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "no, I'm not on anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.85,
      "end_seconds": 126.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.4,
      "end_seconds": 131.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.28,
      "end_seconds": 133.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.29,
      "end_seconds": 139.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.72,
      "end_seconds": 157.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Okay time for your numbers if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.25,
      "end_seconds": 170.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Okay nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.84,
      "end_seconds": 198.51,
      "duration_seconds": 8.67,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.6 degrees, heart rate 84, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, blood pressure 119 over 75."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.58,
      "end_seconds": 202.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.04,
      "end_seconds": 206.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "we'll look at it together shortly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.93,
      "end_seconds": 213.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.08,
      "end_seconds": 217.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.72,
      "end_seconds": 232.2,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "The eyes are slightly red with no discharge and the front of the eye looks clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.33,
      "end_seconds": 239.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.41,
      "end_seconds": 267.15,
      "duration_seconds": 11.74,
      "text": "Okay thinking it through I think we're dealing with dry eye syndrome at this stage. I want to be honest that this is an impression not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.57,
      "end_seconds": 270.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Is this serious doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.09,
      "end_seconds": 285.54,
      "duration_seconds": 13.45,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with dry eye syndrome do well once it's treated properly. An eye test is what I'd like next, for blurred vision"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.0,
      "end_seconds": 288.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "that makes sense"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.17,
      "end_seconds": 299.0,
      "duration_seconds": 9.83,
      "text": "What I'm giving you is lubricant eye drops 1 drop four times a day long term. That should help with dry eyes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.01,
      "end_seconds": 304.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "should I carry on if I feel better?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.57,
      "end_seconds": 324.85,
      "duration_seconds": 19.28,
      "text": "take a screen break every twenty minutes and try to blink fully. If you lose vision or get severe eye pain, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department. Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.08,
      "end_seconds": 336.45,
      "duration_seconds": 8.37,
      "text": "so, I take the lubricant eye drops, 1 drop, four times a day is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.45,
      "end_seconds": 342.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "yes, exactly right. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.87,
      "end_seconds": 347.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "I think I understand everything thanks"
    }
  ]
}